{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30609","headline":"和主司王起 · 李潜","name":"和主司王起","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"文学宗师心秤平，无私三用佐贞明。\n恩波旧是仙舟客，德宇新添月桂名。\n兰署崇资金色重，莲峰高唱玉音清。\n羽毛方荷生成力，难继鸾皇上汉声。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李潜","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_30609.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30609","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}